# 证书与密钥：禁止行尾转换，保证私钥/证书按原始字节入库与检出
*.pem -text
*.key -text
*.crt -text
*.cer -text

# 二进制样本与图片：按二进制处理，避免无意义的行尾/合并处理
*.mp4 -text
*.jpg -text
*.png -text

# Shell entrypoints must remain executable on Linux after a Windows checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Migration SHA-256 is over artifact bytes; Windows checkouts must keep SQL identical.
*.sql text eol=lf
